WEBVTT

01:13.290 --> 01:18.330
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.370 --> 01:23.770
[Episode 32]

01:45.562 --> 01:49.495
[My Father]

01:57.302 --> 01:58.422
Jiahui,

01:59.072 --> 02:01.062
you know me.

02:01.466 --> 02:04.026
Should I make this call or not?

02:07.226 --> 02:09.026
Who's this?

02:12.386 --> 02:14.826
Hello?

02:17.736 --> 02:18.866
Drink shop?

02:20.416 --> 02:21.416
Jinzi...

02:24.946 --> 02:26.546
It's a misunderstanding.

02:27.456 --> 02:28.615
A misunderstanding.

02:28.616 --> 02:31.296
It's okay, it's okay. It all passed.

02:37.666 --> 02:38.856
Please, beauty.

02:38.856 --> 02:40.735
I can't continue my business.

02:40.736 --> 02:43.615
I said I could apologize, okay?

02:43.616 --> 02:44.986
Why should you apologize?

02:46.336 --> 02:48.456
The ones who made trouble should apologize.

02:49.106 --> 02:52.296
Call those guys back, the one called Niqiu.

02:52.296 --> 02:54.065
They are not here.

02:54.066 --> 02:56.065
They came to play with me.

02:56.066 --> 02:57.066
I don't care.

02:57.576 --> 03:00.985
You see, I called Hu Youyu.

03:00.986 --> 03:02.176
He is fine with it now.

03:02.176 --> 03:04.105
Did it have anything to do with you?

03:04.106 --> 03:07.575
Listen, we are sharing the same situation.

03:07.576 --> 03:09.306
You are protecting your friends.

03:09.506 --> 03:11.546
Me too.

03:12.066 --> 03:14.415
Then if you insist,
I can only call the police.

03:14.416 --> 03:15.426
Go ahead.

03:18.136 --> 03:19.416
Please, my beauty.

03:19.416 --> 03:21.826
Please leave me alone.

03:22.106 --> 03:23.216
I really...

03:24.416 --> 03:25.496
Manjun, Manjun!

03:25.986 --> 03:27.496
What are you doing here?

03:30.336 --> 03:31.665
You are...

03:31.666 --> 03:33.266
Hu Youyu, Mr. Hu?

03:33.786 --> 03:35.575
You...you can just call me Hu.

03:35.576 --> 03:37.415
You're Jinzi, right?

03:37.416 --> 03:38.135
Yes, yes.

03:38.136 --> 03:39.216
I'm Jinzi.

03:39.456 --> 03:40.136
Mr. Hu, Mr. Hu!

03:40.136 --> 03:41.136
Mr. Hu,

03:43.226 --> 03:44.615
You see...

03:44.616 --> 03:49.615
I was thinking that I should go to
apologize to you some days later.

03:49.616 --> 03:53.896
But that girl insists
asking my friends to do this.

03:54.456 --> 03:55.855
They are not local.

03:55.856 --> 03:57.665
They came to play with me actually.

03:57.666 --> 03:59.295
The air tickets are not cheap.

03:59.296 --> 04:01.336
It costs thousands for them three.

04:02.226 --> 04:03.735
They are all just employees without money.

04:03.736 --> 04:06.706
I can ask them to call you
to apologize if you agree.

04:07.176 --> 04:09.105
It's okay for me.

04:09.106 --> 04:09.975
It's okay, I don't mind.

04:09.976 --> 04:11.185
Just a misunderstanding.

04:11.186 --> 04:12.536
Yes, a misunderstanding.

04:12.536 --> 04:13.655
A misunderstanding.

04:13.656 --> 04:14.455
Mr. Hu.

04:14.456 --> 04:15.305
You see...

04:15.306 --> 04:19.186
She has been sitting here for days.

04:20.096 --> 04:23.506
Now people all know this.

04:23.826 --> 04:25.016
I feel ashamed of this.

04:25.016 --> 04:28.146
This is just a small business,
it's hard to survive.

04:29.306 --> 04:30.016
Bro...

04:30.016 --> 04:32.335
I didn't know this either.

04:32.336 --> 04:33.216
I'm really sorry.

04:33.216 --> 04:34.296
No, no.

04:34.506 --> 04:35.385
I'm sorry to you.

04:35.386 --> 04:36.066
I'm sorry.

04:36.066 --> 04:36.426
No, no.

04:36.426 --> 04:36.946
I'm sorry.

04:36.946 --> 04:37.946
Okay, fine.

04:42.216 --> 04:43.216
Manjun.

04:43.656 --> 04:45.626
I thought you were going out to play these days.

04:47.576 --> 04:49.378
It's fine for me.

04:49.379 --> 04:51.655
It's so embarrassing.
So many people are watching us.

04:51.656 --> 04:53.215
It's fine.

04:53.216 --> 04:54.656
He doesn't care.

04:57.016 --> 04:59.456
Manjun, why not let me treat you
to Galsang Flower Restaurant?

04:59.456 --> 05:00.895
Let's have lunch, okay?

05:00.896 --> 05:02.015
Let's go for lunch!

05:02.016 --> 05:03.336
Let's go!

05:05.306 --> 05:07.096
I'll give you two days.

05:07.426 --> 05:08.975
No, no, it's okay.

05:08.976 --> 05:09.456
It's fine.

05:09.456 --> 05:10.456
We won't come.

05:10.576 --> 05:11.825
Wish you a booming business.

05:11.826 --> 05:13.305
Let's go, go.

05:13.306 --> 05:14.746
Watch your steps.

05:14.946 --> 05:15.946
Two days!

05:16.426 --> 05:18.026
Let's go!

05:21.626 --> 05:22.626
Here.

05:24.136 --> 05:25.016
Okay, let's go.

05:25.016 --> 05:26.026
You sit back.

05:48.506 --> 05:49.506
Why are you looking at me?

05:50.656 --> 05:52.215
Manjun, try this.

05:52.216 --> 05:52.826
This is good.

05:52.826 --> 05:54.096
This is their specialty.

05:54.336 --> 05:55.336
Have a try.

06:00.656 --> 06:02.266
Just go ahead, what do you want to say?

06:05.186 --> 06:09.776
Shall we talk it over?

06:10.746 --> 06:12.656
Let's forget about it.

06:13.186 --> 06:18.856
Actually, I'm not feeling good if you insist.

06:19.536 --> 06:23.626
They have gone away,
it's unrealistic to call them back.

06:24.216 --> 06:25.746
As a saying goes,

06:25.976 --> 06:29.776
"Forgiving others is to forgive yourself."

06:32.136 --> 06:35.215
You must be thinking that
I am putting my finger in your pie.

06:35.216 --> 06:36.216
No, no.

06:36.216 --> 06:37.975
Totally not.

06:37.976 --> 06:39.495
Not a single moment did I think like this.

06:39.496 --> 06:40.816
I never think like that.

06:42.776 --> 06:48.216
I'm just feeling a bit puzzled.

06:48.866 --> 06:51.296
A little bit too much...

06:54.016 --> 06:57.336
Because this is not an issue.

06:57.976 --> 06:58.976
Right?

07:00.306 --> 07:01.306
Besides,

07:02.096 --> 07:04.215
we haven't met each other for long.

07:04.216 --> 07:06.626
We are just friends living in the same yard.

07:06.826 --> 07:08.336
You are too good to me,

07:08.946 --> 07:14.896
I...I don't deserve that.

07:19.306 --> 07:20.306
Yes, that's all.

07:22.776 --> 07:24.536
I understand.

07:26.216 --> 07:27.946
But don't you want to have a try?

07:36.186 --> 07:38.216
Try...try what?

07:39.706 --> 07:41.746
The feeling to be respected.

07:47.066 --> 07:49.066
To...to be respected?

07:49.896 --> 07:51.416
Manjun, you know what?

07:51.656 --> 07:52.896
Since I started my music career,

07:52.896 --> 07:55.656
I've gotten used to being shameless.

07:56.306 --> 08:00.215
Just because of being shameless,
I've gone so far till today.

08:00.216 --> 08:03.306
If I couldn't accept being beaten
or laughed at by others,

08:03.306 --> 08:05.336
I would soon be depressed.

08:08.216 --> 08:13.626
And you know,
I get all these from my father.

08:14.336 --> 08:15.575
When I started my band at first,

08:15.576 --> 08:16.865
my father didn't agree with it.

08:16.866 --> 08:18.535
He refused to understand me.

08:18.536 --> 08:20.575
Finally, I got a show.

08:20.576 --> 08:23.186
My father called a cab and screwed my show.

08:23.506 --> 08:28.896
He cruelly ruined my guitar and
my drummer's drum when he got there.

08:29.496 --> 08:30.735
He got a bad temper.

08:30.736 --> 08:32.776
Even now, he is like this.

08:34.826 --> 08:38.626
He would smash the cup
if he heard me calling my mom.

08:46.666 --> 08:49.986
Yu, you've been through a lot along this way.

08:50.736 --> 08:52.416
But I can see that you are gifted.

08:53.026 --> 08:56.536
Do you remember that song named Wind
you sang at the live house in Beijing?

08:57.216 --> 09:00.305
It was so amazing when I first heard that.

09:00.306 --> 09:01.856
It's marked in my mind at once.

09:03.426 --> 09:04.896
You're really brilliant.

09:05.576 --> 09:10.056
But not every great person
gets the chance to be seen in this world.

09:16.786 --> 09:18.226
You need to make a living.

09:18.496 --> 09:20.026
You sing at the bar.

09:20.496 --> 09:23.226
But these are not the reasons
to be despised by others.

09:27.856 --> 09:28.856
Do you know?

09:41.616 --> 09:42.746
Come on, uncle.

09:43.376 --> 09:44.376
Come on.

09:44.616 --> 09:45.616
Here, here.

09:49.976 --> 09:51.386
The dishes are ready.

09:53.426 --> 09:53.946
Here.

09:53.946 --> 09:55.426
Put it in front of Uncle Deqing.

09:55.426 --> 09:56.855
Okay. You must wait for a long time.

09:56.856 --> 09:57.825
Come on.

09:57.826 --> 09:58.802
Here.

09:58.826 --> 09:59.705
Okay.

09:59.706 --> 10:00.866
I can reach it.

10:02.496 --> 10:03.425
Yao.

10:03.426 --> 10:07.425
I noticed that you are taking the boss of
the bookstore to visit our village these days.

10:07.426 --> 10:08.426
How's it?

10:09.026 --> 10:10.106
It's still on the way.

10:12.546 --> 10:14.825
When would Honghong come back?

10:14.826 --> 10:16.575
She just left not long.

10:16.576 --> 10:17.576
The ticket is so expensive.

10:17.576 --> 10:19.056
Why would she come back so often?

10:19.826 --> 10:20.905
Then enjoy your dishes.

10:20.906 --> 10:22.145
Call me if you need.

10:22.146 --> 10:23.466
Okay, mind your business.

10:32.066 --> 10:33.386
You have to understand.

10:33.786 --> 10:36.776
Your Grandpa Yang is old with a bad temper.

10:37.426 --> 10:40.335
It's good if someone would rent the old house.

10:40.336 --> 10:41.495
I agree with it.

10:41.496 --> 10:45.065
It's a contribution to
the income of our village.

10:45.066 --> 10:46.656
You are right.

10:49.306 --> 10:50.306
Yao.

10:50.456 --> 10:52.896
I know it's hard for you
to come back to develop tourism.

10:53.306 --> 10:55.696
I grew up with your dad since young.

10:56.616 --> 10:58.145
I really want to help you.

10:58.146 --> 11:01.106
But I don't know how to do that.

11:01.306 --> 11:04.936
You see you devoted so much to this bookstore,

11:05.146 --> 11:08.226
it's good for you if it is done.

11:09.736 --> 11:11.056
You're right, uncle.

11:11.546 --> 11:13.945
But this house is Grandpa Yang's.

11:13.946 --> 11:15.305
I need his approval.

11:15.306 --> 11:17.266
Persuade him if you have a chance.

11:19.146 --> 11:22.025
Let's make the deal with the bookstore.

11:22.026 --> 11:24.146
And I will settle this later.

11:24.976 --> 11:27.705
Uncle,
make sure to get his approval first.

11:27.706 --> 11:29.215
This is his house after all.

11:29.216 --> 11:31.176
We have to listen to his decision.

11:31.616 --> 11:32.495
No worries.

11:32.496 --> 11:33.825
I'll make it.

11:33.826 --> 11:34.936
Come on.

11:42.616 --> 11:45.176
This is good for us.

11:45.376 --> 11:46.456
We are on the same side.

11:46.456 --> 11:47.506
I believe in you.

11:48.119 --> 11:50.389
Huang needs achievement in her career,

11:50.666 --> 11:52.986
we need money for this.

11:54.666 --> 11:59.545
Then just go ahead if you have any request.

11:59.546 --> 12:01.466
I'll try to get it for you.

12:04.376 --> 12:07.536
Since no others are here, I'll go ahead.

12:09.026 --> 12:12.266
I don't need much for the rent.

12:12.546 --> 12:15.816
It'd be good if it's near to
that of Gang's aunt's house.

12:16.706 --> 12:18.346
Gang's aunt?

12:18.616 --> 12:19.616
Where is it?

12:34.306 --> 12:36.416
Here, have some tea.

12:37.096 --> 12:37.705
Thanks.

12:37.706 --> 12:38.706
Thanks.

12:43.376 --> 12:44.536
It's good.

12:45.666 --> 12:46.905
Mr. Ma's tea.

12:46.906 --> 12:50.776
Mr. Ma said that drinking Kungfu tea
is also a good way to cultivate your mind.

12:53.546 --> 12:58.335
So now Uncle Deqing would like to
persuade Grandpa Yang to rent out the house.

12:58.336 --> 13:01.025
But the rent is a bit high.

13:01.026 --> 13:02.186
It's not a bit.

13:02.186 --> 13:04.185
It's too high.

13:04.186 --> 13:07.106
Even if it's a bit high,
we could discuss it with the boss.

13:07.826 --> 13:10.698
But he wants the rent of the hot tourist town.

13:10.699 --> 13:13.215
And said that the boss had so much money.

13:13.216 --> 13:14.825
It's not the case...

13:14.826 --> 13:17.536
He's demanding an exorbitant price,
we can't make it.

13:18.426 --> 13:22.056
So I'm thinking we shouldn't tell this to
the boss of the bookstore first.

13:22.306 --> 13:27.146
If it were me, then I would think that
people here have a bad custom.

13:27.456 --> 13:29.056
They are trying to rob my money.

13:29.706 --> 13:31.106
I'm afraid of that too.

13:31.496 --> 13:34.106
So we can only settle this by ourselves.

13:34.306 --> 13:37.146
Could we ask for a pitch of land
from the committee?

13:38.306 --> 13:39.706
The land here is limited.

13:39.706 --> 13:41.975
And the agricultural land is not allowed to use.

13:41.976 --> 13:44.455
Besides, the boss prefers his old house.

13:44.456 --> 13:45.896
It's so hard!

13:46.826 --> 13:47.705
It's okay.

13:47.706 --> 13:49.296
I can discuss this with him tomorrow.

13:58.706 --> 14:01.145
We can discuss the payment method.

14:01.146 --> 14:02.375
Five-yearly payment.

14:02.376 --> 14:03.856
Then we'll let Huang talk with him.

14:03.856 --> 14:05.575
Increase progressively year by year.

14:05.576 --> 14:07.376
But under the circumstance of having no profit,

14:07.376 --> 14:09.986
it's unreasonable to rent too high.

14:10.456 --> 14:11.456
Yao.

14:11.906 --> 14:13.936
You can't speak for the capital.

14:14.306 --> 14:15.496
You have to stand by my side.

14:15.496 --> 14:17.145
We are in the same boat.

14:17.146 --> 14:18.095
Yes.

14:18.096 --> 14:19.106
Uncle Deqing.

14:19.306 --> 14:20.986
But the rent...

14:21.456 --> 14:23.616
If you are afraid of offending them,
I can talk with them.

14:23.616 --> 14:24.816
I'm not embarrassed.

14:26.146 --> 14:27.746
It's not like that.

14:28.496 --> 14:29.096
This is good.

14:29.096 --> 14:30.176
One more for me.

14:37.426 --> 14:39.746
Shall we ask Zhang
to lead them elsewhere tomorrow?

14:41.576 --> 14:44.375
They thought that it would be hard
for a shuttle bus to drive in at first.

14:44.376 --> 14:48.026
I told them that the atmosphere
here is wonderful and quiet.

14:48.026 --> 14:50.416
Walking and cycling
would also be a specialty for tourists.

14:50.706 --> 14:51.706
Yes.

14:52.066 --> 14:53.735
I said everything I could.

14:53.736 --> 14:56.386
I have no other ways to settle this.

14:58.706 --> 15:00.936
Then I can go to talk with him tomorrow.

15:07.666 --> 15:09.615
Because I'm taking charge of this now.

15:09.616 --> 15:12.776
I can try my best to
rise your rent in a reasonable range.

15:13.026 --> 15:14.425
This is reasonable.

15:14.426 --> 15:17.306
It's my house, I can decide how much to rent it.

15:17.306 --> 15:18.776
Why is it unreasonable?

15:20.066 --> 15:21.066
Yes,

15:21.336 --> 15:23.386
you are right.

15:23.666 --> 15:24.375
Huang.

15:24.376 --> 15:26.305
I think you are a good village officer.

15:26.306 --> 15:27.856
You've done so much for people.

15:27.856 --> 15:29.536
You are on the same side as us.

15:29.976 --> 15:33.025
And I think that
you can do anything you want to do.

15:33.026 --> 15:34.665
Because you are a college graduate.

15:34.666 --> 15:38.176
You are not only capable and well-educated,
but also kind and upright.

15:38.706 --> 15:42.425
Our humble village is honored by your presence.

15:42.426 --> 15:45.146
It's like shining in the sky,
like being painted gold.

15:46.146 --> 15:47.215
I'll wait for your good news.

15:47.216 --> 15:48.216
Okay.

15:50.026 --> 15:51.656
Is it for my dad?

15:52.976 --> 15:53.456
Yes, yes.

15:53.456 --> 15:53.906
Yes.

15:53.906 --> 15:55.466
I almost forgot.

15:56.096 --> 15:57.905
Thanks, thanks a lot.

15:57.906 --> 15:58.495
Thanks.

15:58.496 --> 15:59.575
I'll wait for your good news.

15:59.576 --> 16:00.576
Okay.

16:20.546 --> 16:21.746
What are you doing?

16:22.096 --> 16:25.816
I'm taking off all the tall paper hats
put by Uncle Deqing.

16:26.976 --> 16:28.176
Listen,

16:28.546 --> 16:31.936
Uncle Deqing is like a piece of hob meat.

16:32.976 --> 16:33.786
What?

16:33.786 --> 16:34.786
What's hob meat?

16:34.786 --> 16:35.786
You see,

16:35.906 --> 16:38.375
it's hard to cut, hard to boil,
and hard to eat.

16:38.376 --> 16:41.986
Full of tendons,
and thick-skinned.

16:42.736 --> 16:45.575
Always harassing you with unreasonable
demands without listening to you.

16:45.576 --> 16:47.016
You have nothing to do with him.

16:48.546 --> 16:49.825
Hob meat!

16:49.826 --> 16:51.626
It's just like him.

16:51.906 --> 16:54.975
Something also happened in a town
got developed before.

16:54.976 --> 16:57.336
After the contract was signed
and the rent got confirmed,

16:57.336 --> 17:00.295
the landlord took some people
with him to ask for higher pay.

17:00.296 --> 17:01.865
They would stay there until got paid.

17:01.866 --> 17:03.815
After they succeeded,
others tried to learn from them.

17:03.816 --> 17:06.295
We can't let it happen.

17:06.296 --> 17:11.055
Then I can go to talk with
the secretary if needed,

17:11.056 --> 17:13.536
I'll ask him to see if the committee
could give us a pitch of land.

17:13.976 --> 17:16.466
Is that asshole Deqing asking for money?

17:16.666 --> 17:18.056
The boss refused to rent his house,

17:18.056 --> 17:19.455
so you are asking the committee?

17:19.456 --> 17:21.015
This is not...

17:21.016 --> 17:22.016
Yes!

17:23.146 --> 17:24.146
That's right!

17:25.296 --> 17:27.295
But it's not going public now.

17:27.296 --> 17:28.665
You have to keep the secret.

17:28.666 --> 17:30.776
Uncle Deqing thought that
the boss would rent his house.

17:30.776 --> 17:33.015
But actually the committee
has agreed to approve the land.

17:33.016 --> 17:34.345
Special approval.

17:34.346 --> 17:35.346
It's the most convenient way.

17:35.346 --> 17:37.056
Yes, I know, I know.

17:37.056 --> 17:39.296
I can't say it out.

17:39.296 --> 17:41.425
You have to keep it secret.

17:41.426 --> 17:45.975
Uncle Deqing would be so sad if he knew it.

17:45.976 --> 17:47.296
I know.

17:47.976 --> 17:51.426
I'm here to give Jiahui
some desserts and snacks.

17:52.346 --> 17:53.946
Don't say it out, Aunt Gui!

17:53.946 --> 17:54.946
I won't.

17:56.816 --> 17:59.506
♫ Be brave ♫

17:59.776 --> 18:08.016
♫ The darkness is just in your mind ♫

18:08.666 --> 18:14.842
♫ With the detours in life ♫

18:14.843 --> 18:22.889
♫ we learn to be fearless ♫

18:30.056 --> 18:31.729
♫ To fly ♫

18:39.106 --> 18:41.105
Thanks, my friends.

18:41.106 --> 18:43.056
We will take a 5-minute break,
see you soon.

18:43.056 --> 18:44.056
Thanks.

18:44.776 --> 18:45.986
I'll go out for a smoke.

18:46.496 --> 18:48.535
Manjun is not here today.

18:48.536 --> 18:49.856
She can't be here every day.

18:59.346 --> 19:00.376
Thanks, bro.

19:01.346 --> 19:02.185
Mr. Hu.

19:02.186 --> 19:02.946
Mr. Hu.

19:02.946 --> 19:03.496
You guys again?

19:03.496 --> 19:04.496
What are you doing? Leave me alone!

19:04.496 --> 19:05.666
Mr. Hu.

19:05.666 --> 19:07.186
Go away! Go away from me!

19:07.186 --> 19:08.496
Take it easy! Easy!

19:08.496 --> 19:10.216
We are not here to find trouble for you.

19:10.216 --> 19:11.185
Yes.

19:11.186 --> 19:12.906
We are here to apologize.

19:12.906 --> 19:13.866
Yes.

19:13.866 --> 19:15.456
We were wrong last time.

19:15.456 --> 19:16.216
Yes.

19:16.216 --> 19:17.216
Come here.

19:17.626 --> 19:18.735
1, 2, 3.

19:18.736 --> 19:19.585
Sorry!

19:19.586 --> 19:20.296
1, 2, 3.

19:20.296 --> 19:20.975
Sorry!

19:20.976 --> 19:21.705
1, 2, 3.

19:21.706 --> 19:22.706
Sorry!

19:23.946 --> 19:24.426
Mr. Hu.

19:24.426 --> 19:26.056
Why not beat me to feel better?

19:26.056 --> 19:27.015
Hit me!

19:27.016 --> 19:27.945
Beat me!

19:27.946 --> 19:28.495
Beat me!

19:28.496 --> 19:29.666
What...what are you doing?

19:29.666 --> 19:30.385
Leave me alone!

19:30.386 --> 19:31.106
Beat me!

19:31.106 --> 19:31.906
Mr. Hu, please.

19:31.906 --> 19:32.346
Mr. Hu!

19:32.346 --> 19:33.186
This way please, this way.

19:33.186 --> 19:33.866
Don't panic.

19:33.866 --> 19:35.145
Take it easy.

19:35.146 --> 19:36.295
Don't be nervous.

19:36.296 --> 19:37.616
Take it easy.

19:39.146 --> 19:40.185
Bro!

19:40.186 --> 19:41.376
He is here!

19:42.866 --> 19:43.536
Mr. Hu! Mr. Hu!

19:43.536 --> 19:44.536
Mr. Hu!

19:44.906 --> 19:46.336
You are finally here.

19:47.056 --> 19:48.585
You can just call me.

19:48.586 --> 19:49.455
No.

19:49.456 --> 19:50.816
I have to do this in person.

19:50.816 --> 19:52.026
I'm afraid to be refused.

19:52.666 --> 19:53.216
Yes, yes.

19:53.216 --> 19:54.345
We have to do this in person.

19:54.346 --> 19:56.585
I didn't mind that.

19:56.586 --> 19:57.946
You are generous.

19:58.296 --> 19:58.736
Come on.

19:58.736 --> 19:59.906
This way, please.

20:01.296 --> 20:02.536
Private home cuisine?

20:02.866 --> 20:03.866
Yes, yes.

20:04.296 --> 20:05.296
