20:08.586 --> 20:09.776
I'll listen to you.

20:09.776 --> 20:10.866
No drinks, no drinks definitely.

20:10.866 --> 20:11.776
Come on, let's go.

20:11.776 --> 20:12.776
This way, please.

20:13.186 --> 20:14.906
Watch your steps.

20:15.216 --> 20:16.536
Watch the guitar.

20:16.776 --> 20:17.626
This way.

20:17.626 --> 20:18.626
Yes.

20:19.296 --> 20:20.296
Watch it.

20:24.816 --> 20:28.376
We finally treat Mr. Hu well today.

20:28.816 --> 20:29.866
He is happy.

20:29.866 --> 20:31.426
I have to go to the toilet.

20:32.056 --> 20:34.105
Bro, don't pee here.

20:34.106 --> 20:35.535
The toilet is over there, let's go.

20:35.536 --> 20:36.056
I'll take you.

20:36.056 --> 20:37.266
Me too, me too.

20:39.146 --> 20:40.146
Mr. Hu.

20:41.106 --> 20:44.705
You are my bro from now on.

20:44.706 --> 20:49.186
This is what it called "No discord, no concord".

20:50.186 --> 20:52.026
You are right.

20:52.536 --> 20:57.425
We have to help each other,
and trust each other.

20:57.426 --> 20:58.426
Yes.

21:00.426 --> 21:01.426
Mr. Hu.

21:01.946 --> 21:02.946
Sir!

21:03.216 --> 21:03.866
Sir!

21:03.866 --> 21:06.975
