21:06.976 --> 21:08.146
You forgot something.

21:08.146 --> 21:09.146
This.

21:09.456 --> 21:12.506
It's...yours.

21:12.816 --> 21:13.626
Mine?

21:13.626 --> 21:15.226
Mine is at your place.

21:15.426 --> 21:17.186
I bought these for you.

21:20.146 --> 21:22.376
Why did you buy all these things?

21:23.586 --> 21:25.495
Don't be like this next time.

21:25.496 --> 21:26.735
Take it, take it.

21:26.736 --> 21:27.496
Come on, Mr. Hu.

21:27.496 --> 21:28.946
I... I'll take it for you.

21:28.946 --> 21:30.255
This is fine.

21:30.256 --> 21:31.185
Let's go.

21:31.186 --> 21:32.186
Thanks.

21:33.386 --> 21:34.346
Here, Mr. Hu.

21:34.346 --> 21:35.345
Take it easy.

21:35.346 --> 21:36.426
I'll take it in the car.

21:36.426 --> 21:37.666
It's so nice of you.

21:38.146 --> 21:39.016
I should do it.

21:39.016 --> 21:39.666
Are you okay?

21:39.666 --> 21:40.746
I'm fine.

22:06.456 --> 22:07.706
Manjun!

22:08.586 --> 22:09.906
Manjun!

22:10.296 --> 22:11.376
Open the door.

22:20.816 --> 22:22.296
You drank so much.

22:29.386 --> 22:30.386
Thanks.

22:31.866 --> 22:32.866
What?

22:34.496 --> 22:35.496
It's all yours.

22:37.296 --> 22:38.816
I don't need these.

22:38.816 --> 22:39.856
Take it away.

22:41.866 --> 22:43.616
Then what do you want?

22:44.866 --> 22:46.665
We can talk tomorrow.

22:46.666 --> 22:47.666
Go to bed early.

22:56.346 --> 22:57.346
Manjun.

22:59.056 --> 23:01.226
Why are you being so nice to me?

23:04.866 --> 23:10.426
I'm nothing these years,

23:12.706 --> 23:17.506
no one likes my song.

23:19.016 --> 23:20.016
I...

23:20.426 --> 23:21.816
have no money.

23:22.776 --> 23:24.336
I like flirting.

23:27.426 --> 23:32.026
I'm just a salted duck egg.

23:33.586 --> 23:36.026
I'm all over oil inside and out.

23:39.906 --> 23:41.776
I'm not filial.

23:46.346 --> 23:47.816
Okay, okay.

23:49.056 --> 23:51.376
I'm nothing good.

23:52.536 --> 23:54.226
I'm just a pile of rubbish.

23:56.736 --> 24:01.776
But why are you being so nice to me?

24:03.536 --> 24:06.186
I don't know how to express my gratitude.

24:08.706 --> 24:10.096
You want to express it?

24:13.146 --> 24:14.376
You can do anything?

24:16.296 --> 24:21.096
As long as you say it,
I can do anything for you.

24:26.346 --> 24:29.536
Then promise me never to debase yourself again.

24:30.946 --> 24:32.706
I think you are good enough.

24:35.866 --> 24:37.376
Okay, I don't need anything.

24:37.976 --> 24:39.136
Go back early.

24:51.496 --> 24:52.706
You wanna come in?

25:20.146 --> 25:23.385
Listen, the sound insulation
has to be confirmed.

25:23.386 --> 25:25.055
You can't save this part.

25:25.056 --> 25:26.815
Is it sound insulation?

25:26.816 --> 25:29.856
Isn't it the influence of personal behavior?

25:30.146 --> 25:31.626
You don't have to low down your voice.

25:31.626 --> 25:32.946
They can't hear you.

25:35.386 --> 25:37.496
Would it last for a whole night?

25:37.496 --> 25:40.616
According to my experience,
it can't be too long.

25:41.056 --> 25:42.056
Your experience?

25:42.456 --> 25:43.946
My hotel working experience.

25:57.176 --> 26:00.616
[Youfeng Yard]

26:44.866 --> 26:46.506
Why are you so quiet?

26:46.706 --> 26:47.746
Didn't sleep well?

26:48.146 --> 26:50.426
Why are you making stuffed buns so early?

26:50.776 --> 26:54.015
You said you wanted to eat
your mom's long bean pork stuffed buns.

26:54.016 --> 26:56.536
I'll let you try mine.

27:00.706 --> 27:01.585
What's wrong?

27:01.586 --> 27:02.736
My ear is a bit itching.

27:02.736 --> 27:03.736
Scratch it for me.

27:09.386 --> 27:10.946
Scratch it, scratch it, please.

27:10.946 --> 27:11.946
Scratch.

27:13.976 --> 27:15.026
Upper.

27:20.666 --> 27:21.056
Okay, fine.

27:21.056 --> 27:22.506
Fine.

27:23.976 --> 27:25.146
I'll help you.

27:25.146 --> 27:25.865
No, it's fine.

27:25.866 --> 27:26.906
The last two.

27:28.666 --> 27:29.865
I will tell you a gossip.

27:29.866 --> 27:30.866
Go ahead.

27:33.106 --> 27:34.386
Only us in this kitchen.

27:34.386 --> 27:35.386
You...

27:44.346 --> 27:47.705
I found that you are more
like the aunts in our village.

27:47.706 --> 27:48.456
Gossip girl.

27:48.456 --> 27:49.506
Say it again.

27:50.816 --> 27:51.386
What?

27:51.386 --> 27:52.345
No, no.

27:52.346 --> 27:53.216
I'm making stuffed buns.

27:53.216 --> 27:54.296
Don't...

27:58.496 --> 28:00.015
Are the stuffed buns ready?

28:00.016 --> 28:01.705
I...I almost forgot.

28:01.706 --> 28:03.026
Let me check.

28:04.456 --> 28:04.866
It's ready.

28:04.866 --> 28:05.585
It's done.

28:05.586 --> 28:05.975
Come on.

28:05.976 --> 28:06.456
Let me...

28:06.456 --> 28:07.256
Don't touch it.

28:07.256 --> 28:08.256
It's hot.

28:09.016 --> 28:09.735
Don't touch it.

28:09.736 --> 28:10.425
Don't touch it.

28:10.426 --> 28:11.735
Don't touch it.

28:11.736 --> 28:12.736
Walk out.

28:12.736 --> 28:13.976
And chat with grandma.

28:13.976 --> 28:16.226
I'll tell you as soon as it's ready. Watch it.

28:27.536 --> 28:31.345
What's wrong with the bookstore?

28:31.346 --> 28:34.776
Why did I hear that the committee
was approving the land?

28:35.216 --> 28:36.506
Who said that?

28:36.706 --> 28:38.376
They all say that.

28:39.056 --> 28:42.945
Someone asked me yesterday,
I said how could I know?

28:42.946 --> 28:46.455
If anyone asks you again,
you say that it's true,

28:46.456 --> 28:48.056
but you don't know anything specific.

28:49.626 --> 28:52.336
Deqing's father is bad-tempered,

28:52.666 --> 28:54.616
he's not like your grandpa.

28:55.256 --> 28:57.975
But they are good friends.

28:57.976 --> 29:00.946
They got along well when they were young.

29:01.496 --> 29:04.345
Your father used to go to his place.

29:04.346 --> 29:07.266
He used to give presents to him
during the festivals.

29:08.186 --> 29:10.616
Grandpa Yang was good to me when I was young.

29:10.866 --> 29:13.266
People enjoy the hustle
and bustle when getting old.

29:13.586 --> 29:15.665
My grandma enjoyed it a lot.

29:15.666 --> 29:17.455
Some are not.

29:17.456 --> 29:23.336
My mom would be sleepy and want to go to bed
if being surrounded by too many people.

29:24.186 --> 29:24.905
Yes.

29:24.906 --> 29:26.495
When I went to her house when I was young,

29:26.496 --> 29:28.336
she would take a snap after lunch.

29:28.976 --> 29:31.856
You were too naughty.

29:35.056 --> 29:36.015
Is it delicious?

29:36.016 --> 29:37.906
Is it like your mom's?

29:39.256 --> 29:40.256
It's really good.

29:45.296 --> 29:46.455
Watch it.

29:46.456 --> 29:47.456
It's okay.

29:47.736 --> 29:48.496
Steps are behind you.

29:48.496 --> 29:49.496
Watch the steps.

29:51.216 --> 29:52.216
Okay.

29:54.016 --> 29:55.266
Take it easy.

29:55.586 --> 29:56.586
This way.

30:01.216 --> 30:01.816
Okay, here.

30:01.816 --> 30:02.946
This is okay.

30:05.296 --> 30:07.455
I can do the rest. You go mind your business.

30:07.456 --> 30:08.456
Okay.

30:08.536 --> 30:09.512
Ying,

30:09.536 --> 30:11.096
want to drink coffee? I can buy you one.

30:11.346 --> 30:12.506
You are earning money?

30:12.866 --> 30:14.345
It's getting better recently.

30:14.346 --> 30:15.865
I want a mocha,
add more chocolate.

30:15.866 --> 30:16.866
Okay.

30:19.906 --> 30:20.906
Nana,

30:21.016 --> 30:23.215
Ying wants a cup of mocha with more chocolate.

30:23.216 --> 30:23.906
I want a cup of latte.

30:23.906 --> 30:24.906
Thanks.

30:34.816 --> 30:35.906
Hello everybody,

30:36.426 --> 30:38.096
I'll continue to carve this basin today.

30:38.666 --> 30:41.616
I got this from the grandma
living down the village.

30:43.536 --> 30:44.986
It was used to feed the chicken.

30:45.816 --> 30:46.946
The wood is great.

30:48.216 --> 30:49.376
Let's carve a lotus on it.

31:01.586 --> 31:02.096
Travel around China with Luo Li the Hiker.

31:02.096 --> 31:04.616
[Luo Li the Hiker]
Travel around China with Luo Li the Hiker.

31:04.616 --> 31:05.495
Travel around China with Luo Li the Hiker.

31:05.496 --> 31:08.585
You guys must be curious about where we are now.

31:08.586 --> 31:12.865
Actually, this is a travel vlog.

31:12.866 --> 31:15.705
You used to travel along our recommends.

31:15.706 --> 31:18.976
You are used to traveling after our steps.

31:18.976 --> 31:20.535
But today is a bit different.

31:20.536 --> 31:24.735
Let's try to feel how it is
like to travel along the video.

31:24.736 --> 31:26.015
You guys can search on the internet.

31:26.016 --> 31:29.626
There's a tourism promotional film
called Meet Yourself.

31:29.626 --> 31:29.816
[Meet Yourself]

31:29.816 --> 31:31.535
After watching that video,

31:31.536 --> 31:34.905
I searched for it and found that
few people came here before.

31:34.906 --> 31:36.056
This tofu is so delicious!

31:36.056 --> 31:36.385
[So delicious!]

31:36.386 --> 31:38.185
What's in the coated tofu?

31:38.186 --> 31:39.506
It's just tofu.

31:39.906 --> 31:40.976
Just tofu?

31:40.976 --> 31:41.216
Yes.

31:41.216 --> 31:42.865
Okay, thanks.

31:42.866 --> 31:44.586
Come here, all tofu inside.

31:44.586 --> 31:46.706
Coated tofu.

31:47.106 --> 31:48.336
Grandma Caiyun!

31:49.056 --> 31:49.536
Grandma.

31:49.536 --> 31:51.946
I think your clothes are really beautiful,

31:51.946 --> 31:53.946
so does the headwear.

31:54.736 --> 31:56.376
It's not the most beautiful one.

31:56.976 --> 31:59.226
I think it's beautiful enough.

31:59.496 --> 32:00.496
Look over there.

32:00.776 --> 32:04.186
The girl who is making beverages over
there has a similar hairstyle to mine.

32:04.456 --> 32:06.056
She is so beautiful too.

32:06.456 --> 32:08.256
She's like the so-called natural beauty.

32:08.256 --> 32:09.776
She can be a star right now.

32:10.586 --> 32:14.585
I don't know why I have
a feeling of chasing a star.

32:14.586 --> 32:17.105
Is she famous online?

32:17.106 --> 32:17.496
Of course.

32:17.496 --> 32:19.735
She has nearly 5 million followers.
She is quite famous.

32:19.736 --> 32:21.585
And she praised Nana.

32:21.586 --> 32:23.776
Maybe Nana will go viral online.

32:25.946 --> 32:27.056
Xin, watch out.

32:27.056 --> 32:29.226
President Chun, it's not me.

32:31.906 --> 32:33.336
Continue, let's continue.

32:34.456 --> 32:37.576
I didn't think she was so famous,
so many people are watching it.

32:41.016 --> 32:44.426
Then I want to ask what
pattern is she working on.

32:45.456 --> 32:46.255
That one.

32:46.256 --> 32:47.256
Butterfly.

32:48.186 --> 32:50.186
It's so cute!

32:50.626 --> 32:55.496
Then I will dye a T-shirt or skirt today.

32:55.496 --> 32:58.186
Could you call some people
from the warehouse to pack and deliver goods?

32:58.186 --> 32:59.496
We are too busy.

32:59.496 --> 33:00.975
The packages are in short supply too.

33:00.976 --> 33:02.055
What about the goods?

33:02.056 --> 33:03.386
Some patterns ran out.

33:03.386 --> 33:04.345
Others are fine.

33:04.346 --> 33:05.535
Okay, I will send you some people.

33:05.536 --> 33:06.706
Okay, I'll go now.

33:06.706 --> 33:07.856
Okay.

33:25.946 --> 33:26.946
Hello?

33:28.586 --> 33:29.456
Okay, I know.

33:29.456 --> 33:30.986
Please finish the extra work.

33:31.426 --> 33:32.426
Thanks.

33:32.706 --> 33:33.386
Sen.

33:33.386 --> 33:35.055
Change tamarind fruit to
presell and deliver in one week.

33:35.056 --> 33:35.776
Aunt Feng, Chuchu,

33:35.776 --> 33:37.106
change tamarind fruit to
presell and deliver in one week.

33:37.106 --> 33:38.106
Please explain to customers.

33:38.106 --> 33:38.626
Don't make it wrong.

33:38.626 --> 33:39.472
Okay.

33:39.496 --> 33:42.186
So many bills come immediately,
we are in short supply now.

33:44.016 --> 33:46.345
Yue, call Daxia now.

33:46.346 --> 33:48.335
We are running out of saponin rice,
ask him if they have any.

33:48.336 --> 33:49.336
Okay.

33:49.866 --> 33:51.665
No one can leave now.

33:51.666 --> 33:54.946
So many orders come at once,
we are all busy now.

33:54.946 --> 33:56.706
One of you must come here quickly.

33:57.906 --> 33:58.906
What?

33:59.346 --> 34:00.776
Call Xiaochun?

34:01.736 --> 34:02.706
Okay.

34:02.706 --> 34:03.946
I know, okay.

34:04.986 --> 34:06.815
Live streaming again?

34:06.816 --> 34:08.546
It was a mess last time,

34:08.546 --> 34:10.066
we packed and delivered all night for days.

34:10.066 --> 34:11.336
And then we got so many returns.

34:11.336 --> 34:12.346
So annoying!

34:12.546 --> 34:14.255
All impulsive consumption.

34:14.256 --> 34:16.545
We are so tired
after their impulsive consumption.

34:16.546 --> 34:18.536
Xiaochun, come here now.

34:20.816 --> 34:23.176
Stop, stop! Too much.

34:23.586 --> 34:24.586
Okay.

34:24.936 --> 34:27.536
We are here on the horse ranch.

34:28.026 --> 34:31.775
You see, it's so beautiful here.

34:31.776 --> 34:32.776
Bro,

34:33.416 --> 34:35.216
can we ride outside?

34:35.216 --> 34:36.415
Along the sea?

34:36.416 --> 34:37.295
No, you can't.

34:37.296 --> 34:38.786
You can only ride on the ranch.

34:39.706 --> 34:43.185
The couple who rode along the sea
in your film, is that horse here?

34:43.186 --> 34:45.585
That horse belongs to my boss.

34:45.586 --> 34:47.295
That guy is our boss.

34:47.296 --> 34:50.215
Then is the girl next to him his wife?

34:50.216 --> 34:53.895
No,
it's a volunteer during vacation.

34:53.896 --> 34:55.826
Now she comes back and opens a homestay here.

34:56.376 --> 34:57.986
After making the promotional film,

34:57.986 --> 35:02.066
Xie and I messaged
lots of KOLs to come to play.

35:02.066 --> 35:06.256
We thought that they would like to
promote for us if they felt good.

35:06.256 --> 35:08.736
You see? Hard work pays off.

35:09.216 --> 35:11.105
Although it ends up like this,

35:11.106 --> 35:13.576
the process is not like what you saw.

35:16.186 --> 35:19.586
This was dyed by myself.

35:19.586 --> 35:22.936
Just the one you saw before,
it's really great, isn't it?

35:22.936 --> 35:26.375
Then let's share the story behind
and open the delivery.

35:26.376 --> 35:32.786
I have to make it clear that I would like
to swear by my next life's marriage,

35:33.816 --> 35:38.145
I didn't accept any money for the promotion.

35:38.146 --> 35:41.935
It's a totally self-paying video.
[Not sponsored] [Totally self-paying]

35:41.936 --> 35:44.021
My fans know that
I have done many travel videos,

35:44.022 --> 35:46.185
and internet-famous shop
visiting videos for long.

35:46.186 --> 35:47.985
We've been to so many places around China.

35:47.986 --> 35:49.416
But I think that we've been to so many places,

35:49.416 --> 35:51.095
people can search for travel tips
all over the internet.

35:51.096 --> 35:53.066
So I've been thinking
if I could find some new destinations.

35:53.066 --> 35:54.775
And take you to go over it
and find the shortages.

35:54.776 --> 35:56.625
As for this time,

35:56.626 --> 36:00.066
I found one of my fans told me
in the comment area that this video was great,

36:00.066 --> 36:01.066
why not go there?

36:01.216 --> 36:04.105
I thought it truly was great,
so I chose to have a try.

36:04.106 --> 36:08.855
But to be honest,
I felt so great about this trip.

36:08.856 --> 36:11.256
Because the infrastructure there
may not be so well-developed,

36:11.256 --> 36:15.705
But all I felt was real and comfortable.

36:15.706 --> 36:16.585
So, for real.

36:16.586 --> 36:17.505
Just one sentence.

36:17.506 --> 36:20.416
If you want to feel the wind,
and relax,

36:20.416 --> 36:22.426
I recommend you to go there.

36:26.296 --> 36:27.656
Hello, Mr. Xie?

36:28.736 --> 36:30.946
Xinxin and I are watching the video
of Luo Li the Hiker.

36:32.336 --> 36:33.536
I can ask her.

36:34.026 --> 36:34.985
Are you free?

36:34.986 --> 36:37.296
The dyeing house is short on personnel
to pack and deliver.

36:39.186 --> 36:40.506
Okay, we are coming.

36:43.296 --> 36:44.296
Let's go.

36:44.936 --> 36:46.665
Where would be the bookstore?

36:46.666 --> 36:48.665
The committee is going to give land to it.

36:48.666 --> 36:50.815
Didn't they choose Grandpa Yang's old house?

36:50.816 --> 36:53.216
Grandpa Yang felt that it was too noisy,
so he refused.

36:53.666 --> 36:55.295
But it's good for the village committee
to arrange that.

36:55.296 --> 36:57.216
Everybody can get money each year.

36:57.216 --> 36:58.216
That's good.

36:59.466 --> 37:00.656
Come on, have some oranges.

37:23.026 --> 37:24.096
Is Yao here?

37:24.776 --> 37:25.906
He's inside.

37:30.106 --> 37:31.106
Yao.

37:32.216 --> 37:32.856
Uncle Deqing?

37:32.856 --> 37:33.856
Why are you here?

37:34.216 --> 37:36.616
Still that thing...

37:36.936 --> 37:38.576
let's go out.

37:39.626 --> 37:42.026
That thing? No hurry.

37:42.376 --> 37:43.985
You see? We are busy now.

37:43.986 --> 37:47.105
Huang came here to help even on this day off.

37:47.106 --> 37:49.826
We will talk about it later.

37:50.816 --> 37:51.335
Okay.

37:51.336 --> 37:52.855
No hurry.

37:52.856 --> 37:53.465
It's fine.

37:53.466 --> 37:54.296
I'll wait for you.

37:54.296 --> 37:55.346
Okay.

37:56.256 --> 37:57.946
You are so busy, your business is so good!

38:11.586 --> 38:13.096
Uncle Deqing,

38:14.816 --> 38:16.936
Last time you used the harvester,
you didn't pay the fee.

38:16.936 --> 38:17.936
Others all paid for it.

38:17.936 --> 38:20.656
You can go straight to
the accountant of the committee.

38:21.736 --> 38:22.786
I forgot it.

38:22.986 --> 38:24.065
Then I will go now.

38:24.066 --> 38:24.815
Okay.

38:24.816 --> 38:26.335
Okay, you guys mind your business.

38:26.336 --> 38:27.336
Bye.

38:47.706 --> 38:49.375
What land?

38:49.376 --> 38:50.696
I don't know.

38:50.986 --> 38:52.936
Yao never talks about this to me.

38:52.936 --> 38:54.346
I don't ask him about it, either.

38:55.106 --> 38:57.136
People all say it.

38:57.856 --> 38:59.705
Then that should be true.

38:59.706 --> 39:01.176
There are no waves without wind.

39:01.546 --> 39:05.375
You don't want to rent your land anyway,
it's fine.

39:05.376 --> 39:06.986
Who said it?

39:07.736 --> 39:10.856
Yao and Huang are asking you again and again.

39:10.856 --> 39:12.505
If you like,

39:12.506 --> 39:15.346
how would Huang ask for the land
from the committee?

39:16.336 --> 39:17.826
Huang asked for land?

39:19.586 --> 39:20.855
I spill the beans!

39:20.856 --> 39:24.786
You can't say it out,
or Yao would blame me.

39:26.506 --> 39:27.026
Do you know?

39:27.026 --> 39:28.176
I'm leaving, aunt.

39:29.336 --> 39:31.026
Aunt Yang, I'll get an orange.

39:32.026 --> 39:33.536
Don't say it out!

39:33.896 --> 39:34.705
I won't.

39:34.706 --> 39:36.185
Your basket.

39:36.186 --> 39:37.186
Okay.

39:46.216 --> 39:47.256
That's all?

39:47.466 --> 39:48.466
Yes.

39:48.626 --> 39:49.216
Thanks.

39:49.216 --> 39:50.575
It's hard for you to come over this late.

39:50.576 --> 39:51.336
It's okay.

39:51.336 --> 39:52.375
It's good to have more.

39:52.376 --> 39:53.895
When should I come tomorrow?

39:53.896 --> 39:55.295
Before 4 p.m.

39:55.296 --> 39:55.815
Okay.

39:55.816 --> 39:56.705
Then we are leaving.

39:56.706 --> 39:57.106
Be careful.

39:57.106 --> 39:58.106
Okay.

40:27.856 --> 40:30.135
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

40:30.136 --> 40:32.696
♫ Standing in the road ♫

40:33.096 --> 40:33.856
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

40:33.856 --> 40:35.576
What are you doing there secretly?

40:36.186 --> 40:37.866
Supervising you.

40:38.136 --> 40:40.456
♫ In the air where my memory flows ♫

40:41.466 --> 40:43.096
I'm just kidding.

40:43.856 --> 40:46.215
♫ Take a long way home ♫

40:46.216 --> 40:48.866
What do you want to eat for dinner?
I can make it for you.

40:50.026 --> 40:51.506
Tomato and egg noodles,

40:53.066 --> 40:54.465
made by my grandma.

40:54.466 --> 40:56.736
Fry the tomatoes and stew them into soup.

40:58.706 --> 41:01.256
I can't make the grandma version.

41:02.026 --> 41:04.346
Do you want to try the husband version?

41:05.096 --> 41:07.416
♫ The life we can see ♫

41:10.186 --> 41:12.735
You are always naughty when there are only us.

41:12.736 --> 41:14.026
No words.

41:14.506 --> 41:15.576
Don't tear it.

41:24.416 --> 41:28.756
♫ It's just another day ♫

41:30.466 --> 41:31.506
Xiaochun!

41:34.546 --> 41:37.336
Hulu is asleep now.

41:37.336 --> 41:40.026
I'm here to check if you are done.

41:42.186 --> 41:43.306
Yes.

41:43.506 --> 41:44.786
The goods are delivered.

41:48.889 --> 41:50.185
We were playing.

41:50.186 --> 41:51.656
Yes, playing.

41:54.776 --> 41:56.346
Bro...

41:57.026 --> 41:59.866
what's the relation between you and Hongdou?

42:00.986 --> 42:02.186
What relation?

42:02.186 --> 42:03.536
I said we were playing.

42:06.506 --> 42:07.656
What?

42:08.466 --> 42:10.256
We are in a relationship.

42:11.256 --> 42:12.256
Right?

42:13.296 --> 42:14.296
Yes.

42:14.506 --> 42:15.506
We are.

42:16.106 --> 42:17.106
Bro.

42:17.776 --> 42:19.186
Shame on you.

42:19.186 --> 42:21.065
What's so embarrassing?

42:21.066 --> 42:22.026
Ask any of them,

42:22.026 --> 42:25.096
who doesn't know that
you want to date Hongdou for a long time?

42:26.736 --> 42:27.626
Cut the nonsense.

42:27.626 --> 42:28.626
Nonsense?

42:28.626 --> 42:33.056
You said that the boss of the homestay
is your girlfriend.

42:35.936 --> 42:38.426
I'm afraid Hongdou will feel embarrassed.

42:39.296 --> 42:41.136
What's so embarrassing?

42:41.546 --> 42:42.665
Who doesn't want a date?

42:42.666 --> 42:43.826
Yes.

42:51.706 --> 42:52.775
Xiaochun.

42:52.776 --> 42:55.866
What about you and Hui?

42:57.186 --> 42:59.386
Nothing.

42:59.736 --> 43:01.866
We are done.

43:02.216 --> 43:03.426
Nothing would happen.

43:05.546 --> 43:07.056
He is quite nice.

43:07.896 --> 43:08.736
You are so horrible to him,

43:08.736 --> 43:09.855
he never loses his temper on you.

43:09.856 --> 43:12.775
I don't like him.

43:12.776 --> 43:13.466
Besides,

43:13.466 --> 43:18.176
he always says that
his father bought him a house in town.

43:18.466 --> 43:21.336
He always shows off his parents' money
as a young man.

43:21.336 --> 43:22.506
He is good for nothing.

43:23.336 --> 43:24.255
You see?

43:24.256 --> 43:27.096
He thought that
having a house in town was an advantage,

43:27.506 --> 43:31.786
who knows that
Xie Xiaochun treats money like shit.

43:32.506 --> 43:32.896
No.

43:32.896 --> 43:36.946
Listen, I like money!

43:37.296 --> 43:37.855
Bingo!

43:37.856 --> 43:38.856
Me too!

43:40.336 --> 43:41.335
Fine.

43:41.336 --> 43:42.506
Let's go now.

43:42.736 --> 43:45.775
Listen, bro.

43:45.776 --> 43:48.185
That Mr. Peacock could not bear it anymore.

43:48.186 --> 43:51.736
He waited for Huang
this afternoon at the committee.

43:52.106 --> 43:53.065
Did he meet her?

43:53.066 --> 43:54.256
Of course not.

43:54.706 --> 43:56.386
Who's Mr. Peacock?

43:56.706 --> 43:58.065
Uncle Deqing.

43:58.066 --> 44:00.216
Aunt Baoping likes to call him this.

44:01.736 --> 44:03.561
You know what, Hongdou?

44:03.562 --> 44:08.306
We've heard him boasting since we were young.

44:08.816 --> 44:13.465
He always talks about how brilliant
his grandfather did business at a young age.

44:13.466 --> 44:16.416
How much he earned...
what he ate and drank...

44:16.416 --> 44:17.585
good food and beautiful clothes...

44:17.586 --> 44:19.585
Just like a peacock in his pride.

44:19.586 --> 44:20.786
Boasting everywhere.

44:21.506 --> 44:22.415
I can understand.

44:22.416 --> 44:26.025
I have a colleague in our hotel,
his first name is Jin.

44:26.026 --> 44:28.625
His grandpa's father's first name
is Aisin Gioro.

44:28.626 --> 44:31.025
If it was still the Qing dynasty now,

44:31.026 --> 44:32.696
then he would be a princess.

44:33.336 --> 44:34.336
Awesome.

44:35.186 --> 44:36.186
It's been a long day.

44:36.186 --> 44:37.786
Let's go to bed. Go.

44:43.896 --> 44:48.585
Bro, I'm afraid that
they might return the goods.

44:48.586 --> 44:49.775
We have no other way.

44:49.776 --> 44:51.505
They bought it,
we have to deliver it.

44:51.506 --> 44:52.255
Wait a minute.

44:52.256 --> 44:53.505
Xiaochun, turn off the lights.

44:53.506 --> 44:54.506
Okay.

44:56.936 --> 44:57.936
Turn off the lights.

45:04.816 --> 45:05.816
Okay.

45:07.256 --> 45:08.256
Let's go home. Go.

45:18.696 --> 45:24.216
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

45:26.136 --> 45:31.136
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

45:33.536 --> 45:39.656
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

45:39.936 --> 45:45.336
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

45:48.256 --> 45:53.696
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:55.616 --> 46:00.536
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

46:03.056 --> 46:09.296
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

46:09.576 --> 46:15.816
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

46:17.856 --> 46:24.295
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

46:24.296 --> 46:31.096
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

46:32.456 --> 46:34.495
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

46:34.496 --> 46:38.936
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:39.136 --> 46:46.376
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:51.136 --> 46:56.336
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

46:58.456 --> 47:03.856
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

47:05.856 --> 47:12.255
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

47:12.256 --> 47:19.216
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

47:20.616 --> 47:26.896
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

47:27.096 --> 47:34.056
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

47:35.296 --> 47:37.255
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

47:37.256 --> 47:41.855
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

47:41.856 --> 47:48.896
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

47:49.216 --> 47:56.216
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
